  "scope": "Product user-input submit and queue operations: queue_order dispatch, app_server_user_input submit/route/native-send, server dispatch/repository/error wrapper; shared request idempotency/session guards and owner access; automatic-start admission guards used by desktop input preflight. Generic HTTP/auth/JSON envelope failures and unrelated runtime/session mutations are outside this bounded operation contract.",
