    "command": "git -C <cutex-repository> show <sourceSHA>:<locations.path>",
    "procedure": [
      "Read product functions only; exclude #[cfg(test)] functions/modules and *_tests.rs. Do not grep status tables or tests as producers.",
      "Trace queue_order::dispatch -> steer_queued_v2 -> steer_owner_input -> steer_failure; submit_v2 -> submit_v2_with_repository_and_image_settings -> route_submit_with_image_settings -> send_recorded -> send_user_input_native_request -> native_user_input_failure.",
      "Follow prepare_native_input -> image_steering::claude_path_text -> image_line for dynamic reason values; all steer_unavailable producers are in app_server_user_input.rs, with constructor in queue_order.rs.",
      "Follow server::dispatch_user_input_submit, queue_repository_error, invalid_user_input_error, persistence_user_input_error, post_operation_persistence_error and write_cutex_operation_error_traced; generic outcome_unknown errors become request_outcome_unknown with originalCode/originalDetails and resyncRequired.",
      "Verify shared request guards in handle_cutex_request/access.rs and automatic_runtime_start_error separately; do not infer all session/runtime error variants are input errors."
    ],
